{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_018J3esUAh6YJGJ9BY5SjCuv","type":"tool_result","content":"1\ttier: median\n2\tnarrative_guidance: 'Reframe STA as a principled monitoring/diagnostic tool rather\n3\t  than a complete corrective mechanism. Claim 1 adjusts: \"STA-derived rewards detect\n4\t  and slow structural degeneracy; full prevention likely requires curriculum design\n5\t  or reward shaping beyond the scope of this work.\" Claim 2 downgrades from \"cross-logic\n6\t  transfer patterns\" to \"logic-type-specific hacking mode characterization\" using\n7\t  FOL vs Prolog comparison. Add analysis depth to compensate: detailed hacking taxonomy\n8\t  (plan_012), STA-as-monitoring ablation curves, per-component ISR decomposition.\n9\t  Paper positions as \"methodology + diagnostic tool + empirical characterization\"\n10\t  rather than \"methodology + solution.\" Still viable for EMNLP main if analysis quality\n11\t  is high; Findings if reviewers want stronger prevention evidence.\n12\t\n13\t  '\n14\timagined_experiments:\n15\t- name: FOL exec-only baseline (500 steps, 3 seeds)\n16\t  plan_id: plan_001\n17\t  description: 'FOL single-logic GRPO with execution-only reward. 500 training steps,\n18\t    K=8, 3 random seeds. Establishes the structural degradation trajectory without\n19\t    STA intervention.\n20\t\n21\t    '\n22\t  expected_results:\n23\t    prove_rate_mean_500: 0.26\n24\t    prove_rate_std: 0.03\n25\t    prove_rate_seed1: 0.24\n26\t    prove_rate_seed2: 0.28\n27\t    prove_rate_seed3: 0.25\n28\t    isr_pr_ratio_first100: 0.72\n29\t    isr_pr_ratio_mid_200_300: 0.48\n30\t    isr_pr_ratio_last100: 0.34\n31\t    mean_isr_overall: 0.092\n32\t    mean_isr_last100: 0.089\n33\t    reward_mean_overall: 0.22\n34\t    reward_mean_last100: 0.26\n35\t    parse_rate: 1.0\n36\t    step_time_s: 9.5\n37\t    training_minutes_per_seed: 79\n38\t  result_rationale: '从 100-step pilot (prove_rate=0.15, ISR/PR=1.0) 外推：prove_rate\n39\t    在 500 步内增长到 ~0.26， 因为模型通过 GRPO 学习产生可证明的 FOL 公式。但 ISR/PR 比从 1.0 急剧下降到 0.34， 表明模型越来越多地使用结构退化的捷径（如\n40\t    tautology padding、冗余量词、trivial clause duplication） 来获得 execution reward。这种\"外延正确但内涵退化\"的模式在无\n41\t    STA 约束时加速恶化。 ISR/PR 在中段(step 200-300)已降至 0.48，说明 reward hacking 在训练早期就开始显现。 三种子间\n42\t    prove_rate std=0.03 反映 GRPO 在小数据 FOL 任务上的典型方差。\n43\t\n44\t    '\n45\t  tables:\n46\t  - name: 'Table 1: FOL Exec-Only Training Trajectory (3-seed mean)'\n47\t    columns:\n48\t    - step_range\n49\t    - prove_rate\n50\t    - mean_isr"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01X2Ze8otE8hsT4oHfKSGjkb","session_id":"101daba2-396f-47b1-98e0-5a56827f90df","uuid":"c7662e4b-9381-4035-affd-6538cd6e5033","timestamp":"2026-05-13T22:34:49.819Z"}
