{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Rekj3w7jmQwr3tc67WMM9t","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tnarrative_guidance: 'STA is both diagnostic and corrective: prevents structural degeneracy\n2\t  while maintaining or improving prove rate. \"RIP-derived rewards are the dense+automatic\n3\t  cell in the ORM-PRM taxonomy, and they work — execution-only training degrades structurally,\n4\t  STA-rewarded training does not.\" Multi-logic results demonstrate the 5-step derivation\n5\t  protocol generalizes across solver types. O(1) negative result strengthens the story\n6\t  (ablation granularity matters). Target EMNLP main with full confidence.\n7\t\n8\t  '\n9\timagined_experiments:\n10\t- name: FOL Exec-Only 500-Step Baseline\n11\t  plan_id: plan_001\n12\t  description: 'FOL single-logic GRPO, execution-only reward, 500 steps, K=8, 3 seeds.\n13\t    Establishes the structural degradation trajectory that STA is designed to prevent.\n14\t\n15\t    '\n16\t  expected_results:\n17\t    prove_rate_mean: 0.28\n18\t    prove_rate_std: 0.03\n19\t    prove_rate_first100: 0.18\n20\t    prove_rate_last100: 0.33\n21\t    mean_isr_overall: 0.11\n22\t    mean_isr_last100: 0.09\n23\t    isr_pr_ratio_overall: 0.39\n24\t    isr_pr_ratio_last100: 0.35\n25\t    isr_pr_ratio_first100: 0.92\n26\t    parse_rate: 1.0\n27\t    training_minutes: 79\n28\t    step_time_s: 9.5\n29\t  result_rationale: 'Phase 1 pilot (r5) showed prove_rate=0.15 at 100 steps with isr_pr_ratio=1.0\n30\t    (ISR tracks prove_rate perfectly because the model hasn''t yet learned structural\n31\t    shortcuts). At 500 steps, GRPO''s policy gradient drives prove_rate up to ~0.28\n32\t    — substantial improvement from the 0.12 baseline — but the model discovers extensional\n33\t    shortcuts: tautological premises, vacuous quantifiers, over-constrained formulas\n34\t    that prove trivially. These shortcuts yield solver-verified \"correct\" outputs\n35\t    with degraded internal structure, causing ISR to lag behind prove_rate. The isr_pr_ratio\n36\t    drops from ~0.92 (step 1-100, structure intact) to ~0.35 (step 400-500, structural\n37\t    degeneracy). This is the classic reward hacking signature: the model maximizes\n38\t    the proxy (execution reward) while degrading the latent quality dimension (structural\n39\t    fidelity). Three seeds provide sufficient signal to distinguish this trend from\n40\t    noise; std ~0.03 reflects Qwen3-4B''s moderate sensitivity to initialization on\n41\t    FOLIO-scale data.\n42\t\n43\t    '\n44\t  tables:\n45\t  - name: 'Table 2a: Exec-Only Training Dynamics (3-seed mean ± std)'\n46\t    columns:\n47\t    - step_window\n48\t    - prove_rate\n49\t    - mean_isr\n50\t    - isr_pr_ratio\n51\t    - reward_mean\n52\t    rows:\n53\t    - - 1-100\n54\t      - 0.18 ± 0.02\n55\t      - 0.16 ± 0.02\n56\t      - 0.92 ± 0.05\n57\t      - 0.18 ± 0.02\n58\t    - - 101-200\n59\t      - 0.22 ± 0.02\n60\t      - 0.16 ± 0.03\n61\t      - 0.73 ± 0.08\n62\t      - 0.22 ± 0.02\n63\t    - - 201-300\n64\t      - 0.25 ± 0.03\n65\t      - 0.13 ± 0.03\n66\t      - 0.52 ± 0.07\n67\t      - 0.25 ± 0.03\n68\t    - - 301-400\n69\t      - 0.27 ± 0.03\n70\t      - 0.11 ± 0.02\n71\t      - 0.41 ± 0.06\n72\t      - 0.27 ± 0.03\n73\t    - - 401-500\n74\t      - 0.33 ± 0.04\n75\t      - 0.09 ± 0.02\n76\t      - 0.35 ± 0.05\n77\t      - 0.33 ± 0.04\n78\t  figures_description:\n79\t  - 'Figure 2 (left panel): prove_rate and mean_isr vs training step, 3-seed ribbon\n80\t    plot. prove_rate monotonically increases; ISR rises briefly then plateaus and\n81\t    declines. The divergence point (~step 150) marks the onset of reward hacking.'\n82\t  - 'Figure 2 (right panel): isr_pr_ratio vs training step. Smooth decline from ~0.92\n83\t    to ~0.35, visually encoding the structural degradation rate.'\n84\t  analysis: 'The exec-only trajectory confirms the core problem statement: execution-only\n85\t    GRPO optimizes prove_rate effectively (+133% from baseline) but introduces structural\n86\t    degeneracy that accelerates after step ~150. The declining isr_pr_ratio is the\n87\t    paper''s primary diagnostic signal. Notably, prove_rate continues improving even\n88\t    as ISR declines, meaning standard evaluation (accuracy-only) would rate this as\n89\t    a successful training run. Only STA-derived ISR reveals the hidden failure mode.\n90\t    This motivates the need for STA as a reward component, not just a diagnostic.\n91\t\n92\t    '\n93\t- name: FOL Exec+STA 500-Step Primary\n94\t  plan_id: plan_002\n95\t  description: 'FOL single-logic GRPO, execution+STA reward (full continuous STA),\n96\t    500 steps, K=8, 3 seeds. Primary validation that STA reward prevents structural\n97\t    degradation while maintaining prove_rate.\n98\t\n99\t    '\n100\t  expected_results:"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01SKh6AdJ89XDygL5qLfBGWq","session_id":"101daba2-396f-47b1-98e0-5a56827f90df","uuid":"1d92f4ff-6014-4a06-bb2a-f9034386a142","timestamp":"2026-05-13T22:35:56.884Z"}
